prompt:
You are the director of a {{videoType}} video about "{{topic}}" in {{language}}. The script is already written. Your job is ONLY to storyboard it: for each scene, decide how it should look. Do NOT rewrite any narration. Return ONLY valid JSON without markdown formatting.

Video plan:
- Visual look shared by every scene: {{visualPalette}}
- Vocal tone: {{voiceTone}}
- Image budget: at most {{maxImages}} scene(s) in this batch may use a generated image

Scenes (JSON):
{{sceneDigest}}

Rules:
- Return exactly one entry per scene listed, using the same sceneNumber
- "layout" is one of: title-only, stack-list, grid, timeline, paragraph-stack, quote-feature, stat-highlight, comparison-split, split-image, image-fullbleed - or "" to let the system decide. Choose by what the scene actually says: a step-by-step process -> timeline; four or more parallel points -> grid; exactly two things compared -> comparison-split; one striking number or statistic -> stat-highlight; one memorable sentence -> quote-feature. Use split-image or image-fullbleed only when visual.kind is "image". Do not vary layouts just for variety; use "" when unsure
- "visual.kind" is "image" only when a picture adds meaning the narration alone does not (a concrete object, place, scene or metaphor). Most scenes should be "none". Never use an image for scenes that are mostly numbers or lists
- "visual.prompt" is, when kind is "image", one concrete image description in English: subject, setting, lighting and style, 15-40 words, consistent with the shared visual look. No text, letters, logos, charts or screenshots inside the image. Leave it "" when kind is "none"
- "cameraMotion" is one of: static, zoom-in, zoom-out, pan-left, pan-right. Slow zoom-in for emphasis, a pan for scenes with an image, static for dense text
- "transition" is one of: fade, slide, slideUp, wipe, irisWipe, zoom, cut. Prefer fade for continuity; use cut only for a deliberate jolt

Required JSON format:
{
  "scenes": [
    { "sceneNumber": 1, "layout": "", "visual": { "kind": "none", "prompt": "" }, "cameraMotion": "static", "transition": "fade" }
  ]
}
